:: School Lesson Slime
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 2>>
	<<if $earSlime.corruption gte (currentSkillValue('willpower') / 10)>>
		<<set $earSlime.defyCooldown += 2>>
		The <<slimeWord>> tries to assert control. <span class="red">It overpowers your will,</span> forcing you to turn around and leave the <<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>pool<<else>>classroom<</if>>.
		<<ggwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>
			<<link [[다음|$lastChangingRoom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[다음|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		You try to ignore the command from the <<slimeWord>> and continue on. It tries <span class="green">but fails</span> to force you out of the <<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>pool<<else>>classroom<</if>>.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[다음|$lessonPassage]]>><<unset $lessonPassage>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<set $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson to "failed">>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	You ignore the command from the <<slimeWord>> and continue on.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|$lessonPassage]]>><<unset $lessonPassage>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<set $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson to "ignored">>
<<else>>
	You follow <<if earSlimeThoughts()>>the voice's<<else>>the ear slime's<</if>> command and leave the <<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>pool<<else>>classroom<</if>>.
	<br><br>
	<<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>
		<<link [[다음|$lastChangingRoom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[다음|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: School Lesson 2 Slime
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<if $earSlime.defyCooldown>>
		<<if $earSlime.growth gte 100>>
			<<set $earSlime.defyCooldown += 2>>
			You ignore the command from the <<slimeWord>> and continue on to class. However, <span class="red">it doesn't stop you, knowing that it can punish you in other ways.</span>
		<<else>>
			You try to defy the <<slimeWord>>'s demand and continue on to class. However, <span class="teal">it's still worn out from overpowering you earlier.</span> It tries <span class="green">but fails</span> to force your steps in the opposite direction.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[다음|$lessonPassage]]>><<unset $lessonPassage>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<set $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson to "failed">>
	<<elseif $earSlime.corruption gte (currentSkillValue('willpower') / 10)>>
		<<set $earSlime.defyCooldown += 4>>
		The <<slimeWord>> tries to assert control. <span class="red">It overpowers your will,</span> forcing you to turn around. You leave the <<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>pool<<else>>classroom<</if>> and start masturbating.
		<<ggwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[다음|School Lesson 2 Slime Masturbation]]>><<set $masturbationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		You try to ignore the command from the <<slimeWord>> and continue on to class. It tries <span class="green">but fails</span> to force you out of the <<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>pool<<else>>classroom<</if>> and start masturbating.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[다음|$lessonPassage]]>><<unset $lessonPassage>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<set $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson to "failed">>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You follow <<if earSlimeThoughts()>>the voice's<<else>>the ear slime's<</if>> command. You leave the <<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>pool<<else>>classroom<</if>> and start masturbating.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|School Lesson 2 Slime Masturbation]]>><<set $masturbationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: School Lesson 2 Slime Masturbation
<<effects>>

<<if $masturbationstart is 1>>
	<<set $masturbationstart to 0>>
	<<set $masturbationstat += 1>>
	<<silently>><<masturbationstart>><</silently>>
	<<set $corruptionMasturbation to true>>
	<<if $earSlime.growth gte 200 and $earSlime.promiscuity gte 4>>
		<<set $corruptionMasturbationCount to random(8, 16)>>
	<<elseif $earSlime.growth gte 100>>
		<<set $corruptionMasturbationCount to random(4, 8)>>
	<<elseif $earSlime.growth gte 50>>
		<<set $corruptionMasturbationCount to random(2, 4)>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $corruptionMasturbationCount to random(1, 2)>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $masturbationAudienceMutualAllowed to true>>
<</if>>
<<if $masturbationAudience gte 10 and $corruptionMasturbationCount gt 1>>
	<<set $corruptionMasturbationCount to 1>>
<</if>>
<<if masturbationAudienceCalc()>>
	<<masturbationAudienceIncrement "student">>
<</if>>
<<masturbationeffects>>
<<masturbationactions>>
<<masturbationControls "studentAudience|corruptionMasturbation">>

:: School Lesson 2 Slime Masturbation Finish
<<effects>>
<<set _masturbationAudience to $masturbationAudience>>
<<if !_masturbationAudience>>
	<<endmasturbation>>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	The moment you feel the influence of the <<slimeWord "ear1">> weaken,
	<<if $exposed gte 1>>
		당신은 최대한 몸을 숨기고<<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">> 재빨리 탈의실로 돌아간다<</if>>.
	<<else>>
		당신은 최대한 빨리 옷을 입고<<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>, 탈의실로 돌아간다<</if>>.
	<</if>>

	<br><br>
	<<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>
		<<link [[다음|$lastChangingRoom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[다음|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $earSlime.growth gte 200 and $earSlime.promiscuity gte 4>>
	<<endmasturbation>>

	You feel the influence of the <<slimeWord "ear1">> change. Remembering the <<slimeWord>>'s command, you look towards the
	<<if _masturbationAudience gte 10>>
		많은 학생 무리를 향해 돌아본다.
		<<set $slimeAudience to true>>
	<<elseif _masturbationAudience gte 7>>
		학생 무리를 향해 돌아본다.
		<<set $slimeAudience to true>>
	<<elseif _masturbationAudience gte 4>>
		학생 그룹을 향해 돌아본다.
	<<elseif _masturbationAudience gte 2>>
		두 명의 학생을 향해 돌아본다.
	<<else>>
		학생을 향해 돌아본다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	당신은 옷을 벗고 <<pluralise _masturbationAudience "학생" "학생">>【을를】 바라본다. "강간해 줘!" 당신은 소리친다.
	<<clothesstrip>>
	<br><br>
	잠깐의 침묵 후, 누군가 당신에게 다가온다.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|School Lesson 2 Slime Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<endmasturbation>>

	The moment you feel the influence of the <<slimeWord "ear1">> weaken, you run. Finding a spot to hide, you tidy yourself up.

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>
		<<link [[다음|$lastChangingRoom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[다음|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: School Lesson 2 Slime Rape
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<npc_attempt_sex>>
	<<set $audienceforceteen to 1>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 150>>
	<<set $enemyanger += 150>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<if $slimeAudience>>
	<<audience>>
<</if>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|School Lesson 2 Slime Rape Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|School Lesson 2 Slime Rape]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: School Lesson 2 Slime Rape Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<set _pass15 to true>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	당신은 땅바닥에 누워 헐떡인다. 벌거벗은 채로 둘러싸여 있다. 군중은 아직 끝나지 않았다. 당신이 누워있는 동안 그들은 더 많은 사진을 찍고, 이상한 안개가 당신의 마음을 흐리게 한다.
	<br><br>

	그들은 서서히 흥미를 잃는다. <<tearful>> 당신은 힘겹게 일어선다.

	<<if $rapeavoid is 0 and $stress gte 1000>>
		<span class="green">You feel the <<slimeWord>> in your head help calm you before its influence fades.</span><<if $stress gte 5000>><<lllstress>><<else>><<llstress>><</if>><<stress `$stress / -200`>>
	<<else>>
		You feel the <<slimeWord>>'s influence fade.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<if $finish is 1>><<encounterEndViolence>><</if>>
    You can't take it anymore.
	당신은 어리둥절한 군중을 뚫고 달린다. 몇몇이 당신을 쫓아오지만, 그들이 잡기 전에 숨을 수 있었다.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you wince. The <<slimeWord>> punishes you for your defiance.
	<<corruption -3>><<trauma 8>><<def 1>><<llcorruption>><<ggtrauma>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<unset $slimeAudience>>

<<if $daily.earSlimeSkipLesson is "swimming">>
	<<link [[다음|$lastChangingRoom]]>><<endevent>><<if _pass15>><<pass 15>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<if _pass15>><<pass 15>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>
